      "content": "Thought: I'll start by evaluating a baseline configuration with common operations to establish a performance reference point. Given this is a neural architecture search task, I'll begin with a mix of convolutional and skip connections which are typically strong performers in such search spaces.\n\nAction: evaluate_config {\"1<-0\": \"nor_conv_3x3\", \"2<-0\": \"nor_conv_3x3\", \"2<-1\": \"nor_conv_3x3\", \"3<-0\": \"nor_conv_3x3\", \"3<-1\": \"nor_conv_3x3\", \"3<-2\": \"nor_conv_3x3\"}"
