      "content": "Thought: The baseline with all 3x3 convolutions gives 0.709 performance. This is a good starting point but likely has high computational cost. Let me try a configuration with skip connections which often provide better gradient flow and can improve performance while reducing cost. I'll test a mix of skip connections and 1x1 convolutions.\n\nAction: evaluate_config {\"1<-0\": \"skip_connect\", \"2<-0\": \"skip_connect\", \"2<-1\": \"skip_connect\", \"3<-0\": \"skip_connect\", \"3<-1\": \"skip_connect\", \"3<-2\": \"skip_connect\"}"
